      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start, the vibe is definitely there. but looking at the engine readout, that bit is only hitting a really low depth score... like, way below what we usually need for a main questline.\n\nthe producers are gonna be breathing down my neck if the quest feels \"thin.\" can you try expanding on this? maybe add more detail about the specific legends of the Hollows or what Elara is actually guarding? just... please keep the quality high. i really mean it, don't just loop the same sentences or add useless adjectives just to get the word count up. i need actual lore content.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
